    - `1b-ruff-format`: `ruff format --check .`
    - `2-bandit`: `bandit -r src -ll`
    - `2b-nosec-scan`: `grep -rn "nosec" src`, which passes only when nothing is found
    - `3-pytest`: `pytest --cov=order_agent --cov-branch --cov-report=term-missing --cov-fail-under=90`
  - write `environment.txt` (`python --version`, `pip freeze`, `git rev-parse HEAD` or `no commit`);
  - write `summary.md`: a step table (step id | command | exit code | PASS/FAIL), then gates (Gate 1 = 1a AND 1b; Gate 2 = 2 AND 2b; Gate 3 = 3), then `OVERALL: PASS|FAIL`;

